		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Half-goat demon with horns, cloven hooves, and long tongue. Carries a burlap sack for abducting victims.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 57, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +6 (1d10) and capture, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Capture</strong>. Opposed DEX to stuff a target within close in bag. Total darkness inside, bag breaks and releases all held if dealt 20 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Immortality</strong>. Reincarnates in a year if slain. Holds a grudge against those who slew it.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
